  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSR and sustainability training for business hubs and schools (Part I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is for incubators and coworking spaces (from now on: business hubs) and business schools (for professionals) to have incorporated sustainable thinking in the programmes, services and education they offer to start-ups, small- and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) or clients. In addition, CSR Ukraine has gained the knowledge and materials to repeat the training in the future.</narrative>
  </description>
